--- !u!114 &1112987128338330701
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3882272147560746744}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 58df34aec2d538549ab0dd4e59486d52, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialogue:
  - Hello, Hero! Take a look at the image above. It shows how to move around. Use
    the glowing arrows to walk when you're ready. Practice this after you close the
    tutorial!
  - "Great job so far! The image above shows a treasure chest. When you see one in
    the game, walk up to it and tap to open. Treasures hold helpful items\u2014remember
    to collect them when you\u2019re back in the action!"
  - "Don\u2019t worry about enemies! Look at the image above to see how to fight.
    Tap the sword icon to attack, and if you have a special ability, it will light
    up. You\u2019ll get to try this after the tutorial ends!"
  - "Well done, Hero! You\u2019ve seen how to move, collect treasures, and fight
    enemies. When you close this tutorial, you can try it all for yourself. Remember,
    the Help menu is always there if you need a reminder!"
  _title: Tutorial Title
  _subtitles:
  - 'Page 1: Welcome to Your Adventure!'
  - 'Page 2: Collecting Treasures'
  - 'Page 3: Battling Enemies'
  - 'Page 4: Wrapping Up'
  _images:
